(7437580, 1175887, 117474, '<td valign="top">I should explain what I''d like to see in these images. I would love to see people''s interpretation of a monkey year would mean to them. <br/> <br/>I just see a monkey and I haven''t learnt anything. Sorry. This doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'I should explain what I''d like to see in these images. I would love to see people''s interpretation of a monkey year would mean to them.  I just see a monkey and I haven''t learnt anything. Sorry. This doesn''t do it for me.', '2016-02-16 19:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7437581, 1175903, 117474, '<td valign="top">This certainly embodies what I would expect for a new year celebration. Dragons, family, fun. (is that a dragon?) I was hoping to learn something from these images about the year of the monkey. And especailly about peoples'' interpretations about what a monkey year is. I''m afraid I don''t get much from this image.</td>', 'This certainly embodies what I would expect for a new year celebration. Dragons, family, fun. (is that a dragon?) I was hoping to learn something from these images about the year of the monkey. And especailly about peoples'' interpretations about what a monkey year is. I''m afraid I don''t get much from this image.', '2016-02-16 19:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7437582, 1175871, 117474, '<td valign="top">Yes. this and the challenge have a word in common. I would love to see people''s interpretation of a monkey year would mean to them. I''m not an expert of course, but I hoped to learn something from these images. I haven''t learnt much from this one I''m afraid.</td>', 'Yes. this and the challenge have a word in common. I would love to see people''s interpretation of a monkey year would mean to them. I''m not an expert of course, but I hoped to learn something from these images. I haven''t learnt much from this one I''m afraid.', '2016-02-16 19:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
