(7438574, 1175970, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s dog in a monkey show. I see no homage to the challenge theme at all. Also, there is something a little too crunchy about the processing where the dog is concerned, a personal taste thing for me...looks a little too HDRish to my eye. 3</td>', 'It''s dog in a monkey show. I see no homage to the challenge theme at all. Also, there is something a little too crunchy about the processing where the dog is concerned, a personal taste thing for me...looks a little too HDRish to my eye. 3', '2016-02-21 09:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438575, 1175923, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s a stuffed animal on a plain white background in artless lighting...one of these things would need to change to make for a more interesting image.</td>', 'It''s a stuffed animal on a plain white background in artless lighting...one of these things would need to change to make for a more interesting image.', '2016-02-21 09:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438579, 1175713, 35804, '<td valign="top">My top pick...beautiful B&amp;W and you''ve managed to bring me there and put me in the middle of it all. 10</td>', 'My top pick...beautiful B&W and you''ve managed to bring me there and put me in the middle of it all. 10', '2016-02-21 10:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438580, 1175995, 35804, '<td valign="top">The light is beautiful as are the subjects. I have a hard time getting past the obvious zoo setting, nothing a shallower depth of field wouldn''t fix but you may not have such a lens in your arsenal. Still an 8.</td>', 'The light is beautiful as are the subjects. I have a hard time getting past the obvious zoo setting, nothing a shallower depth of field wouldn''t fix but you may not have such a lens in your arsenal. Still an 8.', '2016-02-21 10:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438581, 1175903, 35804, '<td valign="top">Fun and awesome energy...makes me wish I were there! I dislike the white vignette intensely, personal preference. 7</td>', 'Fun and awesome energy...makes me wish I were there! I dislike the white vignette intensely, personal preference. 7', '2016-02-21 10:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438582, 1175935, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice monkey picture, maybe a little over sharpened and more exposure, shadow/highlight control would be desirable, but I''ll give you a 6 for staying on topic.</td>', 'It''s a nice monkey picture, maybe a little over sharpened and more exposure, shadow/highlight control would be desirable, but I''ll give you a 6 for staying on topic.', '2016-02-21 10:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438584, 1175978, 35804, '<td valign="top">The elements are there but the one thing missing is some good light and maybe a more artful arrangement, a different depth of field perhaps. It''s all very flat to my eye. Still a 6 for a good effort.</td>', 'The elements are there but the one thing missing is some good light and maybe a more artful arrangement, a different depth of field perhaps. It''s all very flat to my eye. Still a 6 for a good effort.', '2016-02-21 10:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438585, 1175968, 35804, '<td valign="top">I''ve dinged other images with similar elements, but the shallow DOF makes this so much more interesting. Oddly, or maybe not, that curled purple ribbon adds the right amount of "celebration". Without it I would have given this a 4. With purple ribbon, 6</td>', 'I''ve dinged other images with similar elements, but the shallow DOF makes this so much more interesting. Oddly, or maybe not, that curled purple ribbon adds the right amount of "celebration". Without it I would have given this a 4. With purple ribbon, 6', '2016-02-21 10:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438586, 1175887, 35804, '<td valign="top">At least there is a monkey, and the light is not unfortunate..but I''m not a fan of the processing. There''s something weird and HDRish in a bad way about it. 6</td>', 'At least there is a monkey, and the light is not unfortunate..but I''m not a fan of the processing. There''s something weird and HDRish in a bad way about it. 6', '2016-02-21 10:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438588, 1175951, 35804, '<td valign="top">Light is gorgeous, the comp is not horrible and the DOF is appealing. I''m one of the weirdos that dings for artless titles though. Still a 7...you''ve made me want to crunch into a fortune cookie!</td>', 'Light is gorgeous, the comp is not horrible and the DOF is appealing. I''m one of the weirdos that dings for artless titles though. Still a 7...you''ve made me want to crunch into a fortune cookie!', '2016-02-21 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438589, 1175999, 35804, '<td valign="top">Rather nice light...I only wish for a more pulled back, larger, more breathing room view and maybe more creative composition, but I realize that may not have been possible so it doesn''t matter what I wish for. Oh, and the DOF choice is nice. 7</td>', 'Rather nice light...I only wish for a more pulled back, larger, more breathing room view and maybe more creative composition, but I realize that may not have been possible so it doesn''t matter what I wish for. Oh, and the DOF choice is nice. 7', '2016-02-21 10:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438590, 1175960, 35804, '<td valign="top">Cute, I like the motion and the pop of the red shoe and your cheeky title. But you know this is a shoehorn, which is not horrible in it self, still a 4.</td>', 'Cute, I like the motion and the pop of the red shoe and your cheeky title. But you know this is a shoehorn, which is not horrible in it self, still a 4.', '2016-02-21 10:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438591, 1175900, 35804, '<td valign="top">The DOF is effective as is the comp..but the RED, the RED. I don''t like it at all. Maybe a slightly softer, toned down monotone red? It''s all personal preference. RED!!!! 4</td>', 'The DOF is effective as is the comp..but the RED, the RED. I don''t like it at all. Maybe a slightly softer, toned down monotone red? It''s all personal preference. RED!!!! 4', '2016-02-21 10:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438593, 1175871, 35804, '<td valign="top">You''re pushing it. I would have at least cloned/healing out the peanut shrapnel on the glass surface. The light is nice, I''ll give you that, but the comp is lazy too. 3 because you know this is pushing the challenge theme and good light will only get you so far.</td>', 'You''re pushing it. I would have at least cloned/healing out the peanut shrapnel on the glass surface. The light is nice, I''ll give you that, but the comp is lazy too. 3 because you know this is pushing the challenge theme and good light will only get you so far.', '2016-02-21 10:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438594, 1175953, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s Chinese, I''ll give you that but it seem overprocessed to me...colorful but flat in a bad way. 4</td>', 'It''s Chinese, I''ll give you that but it seem overprocessed to me...colorful but flat in a bad way. 4', '2016-02-21 10:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438595, 1175856, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like the lantern''s glow and the ink monkey. IMO this would have been more interesting without the little plastic toy and a more artful composition/arrangement maybe? I''m still on the line about a different DOF. This still life is due some more experimentation. I''m going to bump to a 6 from a 4.</td>', 'I really like the lantern''s glow and the ink monkey. IMO this would have been more interesting without the little plastic toy and a more artful composition/arrangement maybe? I''m still on the line about a different DOF. This still life is due some more experimentation. I''m going to bump to a 6 from a 4.', '2016-02-21 10:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438598, 1175905, 35804, '<td valign="top">It is a thin tie, and I mean THIN tie to the theme...mums and their Asian lore and roots. It''s a decent shot, to my eye maybe a little too smooth and oddly flat. 3</td>', 'It is a thin tie, and I mean THIN tie to the theme...mums and their Asian lore and roots. It''s a decent shot, to my eye maybe a little too smooth and oddly flat. 3', '2016-02-21 11:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438599, 1175826, 35804, '<td valign="top">Yes...Golden Phoenix and the Chinese Year of the Monkey...no, I don''t see the tie at all. Some breathing room around the neon sign, some context even, would have made this a lot more interesting IMO. 3</td>', 'Yes...Golden Phoenix and the Chinese Year of the Monkey...no, I don''t see the tie at all. Some breathing room around the neon sign, some context even, would have made this a lot more interesting IMO. 3', '2016-02-21 11:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438600, 1175925, 35804, '<td valign="top">Dang it, it''s a grand shot of the bird, and an appealing shot all around, but I''m giving you a 4 for getting ahead of yourself.</td>', 'Dang it, it''s a grand shot of the bird, and an appealing shot all around, but I''m giving you a 4 for getting ahead of yourself.', '2016-02-21 11:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438601, 1175955, 35804, '<td valign="top">You are stubborn. But you made me look shit up...seriously, and I had fun. I found out I''m an Earth Monkey in the Chinese Zodiak. I like that! I don''t know if that was your intention and I don''t care one way or the other. Just for making me expand my knowledge today, I''m giving you a 6...nope, a 7. I like the title too...it''s <i>that</i> title that made me learn something unexpected today. Technically, this could do with a tad more contrast maybe? No, I''m giving you an 8...some interesting conceptual work here the more I mull this over.</td>', 'You are stubborn. But you made me look shit up...seriously, and I had fun. I found out I''m an Earth Monkey in the Chinese Zodiak. I like that! I don''t know if that was your intention and I don''t care one way or the other. Just for making me expand my knowledge today, I''m giving you a 6...nope, a 7. I like the title too...it''s that title that made me learn something unexpected today. Technically, this could do with a tad more contrast maybe? No, I''m giving you an 8...some interesting conceptual work here the more I mull this over.', '2016-02-21 11:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438603, 1175997, 35804, '<td valign="top">I just find it boring, and wanting to see more detail in the front most wrench from a technical POV. And surely you must know you''re pushing the topic boundaries yes? I have to say the light on the back wrench is lovely though. Still I''m giving you a 3.</td>', 'I just find it boring, and wanting to see more detail in the front most wrench from a technical POV. And surely you must know you''re pushing the topic boundaries yes? I have to say the light on the back wrench is lovely though. Still I''m giving you a 3.', '2016-02-21 11:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438606, 1175892, 35804, '<td valign="top">An artlessly flash lit shot of hanging stuffed animals will not win my heart. Some context and better light may have gotten you something higher than the 3 I''m giving this, because at least they are on subject.</td>', 'An artlessly flash lit shot of hanging stuffed animals will not win my heart. Some context and better light may have gotten you something higher than the 3 I''m giving this, because at least they are on subject.', '2016-02-21 11:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438607, 1175772, 35804, '<td valign="top">A conceptual take on it that works for me. For some reason I''m loving the graphic-ness and flow of that crosswalk...it''s energy working in harmony with the hatted man and his stuff. You''re good at this. 7</td>', 'A conceptual take on it that works for me. For some reason I''m loving the graphic-ness and flow of that crosswalk...it''s energy working in harmony with the hatted man and his stuff. You''re good at this. 7', '2016-02-21 11:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7438611, 1175982, 35804, '<td valign="top">The elements are there...a monkey, a calendar. For me it fails as a still life. The black backgound is dull but the absence of beatiful light is what kills it imo...and the ladder, I don''t get the ladder.</td>', 'The elements are there...a monkey, a calendar. For me it fails as a still life. The black backgound is dull but the absence of beatiful light is what kills it imo...and the ladder, I don''t get the ladder.', '2016-02-21 11:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
