(7439040, 1175892, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RKT:</b></div><hr/><i> An artlessly flash lit shot of hanging stuffed animals will not win my heart. Some context and better light may have gotten you something higher than the 3 I''m giving this, because at least they are on subject. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for the generous vote of "3".  I resent your comment of "artlessly flash lit".  Who are you to say such a thing?  Oh, yeah.  I just looked at your portfolio and I see what a genuine artist you are.</td>', 'Originally posted by RKT: An artlessly flash lit shot of hanging stuffed animals will not win my heart. Some context and better light may have gotten you something higher than the 3 I''m giving this, because at least they are on subject.  Thanks for the generous vote of "3".  I resent your comment of "artlessly flash lit".  Who are you to say such a thing?  Oh, yeah.  I just looked at your portfolio and I see what a genuine artist you are.', '2016-02-23 09:43:17.000000', NULL, 0),
